<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-06T21:41:17.445Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:41:17 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Niger army rescued 16 abductees, recovered 38 motorcycles, AK-47 rifles, RPGs, weapons and ₦4.7 million, while terrorists killed several of their own members during the operation. In Burkina Faso jihadist pressure increased, prompting local leaders to hail the AES force. Russian electronic-warfare vehicles were observed operating in Mali. Nigeria announced it will not negotiate a cease-fire with Islamists and will maintain its offensive. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOUEFjcUtwYVI0TjVoRjkwQjRLY2FUYms5OThZTk5RYng2S2dNbXE1SVp1aDJfRGxMMDRId2h5bl9nYjkwcXhTQ2xTcUtRUVU5QXo5X2VBcnpYWld4dWc3WXdvY0tuWUR3Y1JtMGR0YWdkNGxkM0RFVVRGemJzX1d6TlYtUzZtVElVQ1hzTXFyeERlUVByV0FzSFNQUjlKdEVIdXR6eUtiMHVCZVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxONGZXR3FPRUdKTXk3cmZ6NEJid05TUGNra2hHUjhiUkpxLUhpSnpNWWpKNFNoSFBDRW5sMS1yQUFLTjd3U2dxbFJ3UzhZYVJFUVctaFdiNDBJM3VXMm5yZWdjMjI1dmNNWThUNVB3YUphaGlqa0o1TnBzRzBCalFXN0ZjTTIyaEZKOHlhRW5hT1R4VlE5LU5ZYWRqR1NlS0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOWk9XeURkTFZmRUJKSEhRVzFBZjRIUG41bFFuNG1NOE9VYWFjSi15UVFnR2lYemItcGw0SmRQck9RWE5YbG1KSHZ2SXNhMGtwQmN3OFBtc0doM2VlNVlOd1pnZEN4LW9ZaDBZOXZsdkpHX044MVBubUZTOEl5bTBHcm5fV3YyVHUxdjBfd3c0WTRaUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bénin Web TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPOHlzU0U4bGlPU1QyQXNDVnBWM2FNU21TNmRDU0JBbk40MjFTOTJXSGltbUlLTW9TOWhuaHd1Y2tEQVRoUzVLdXNzVEJ3ZE1LbWlyaEkwX05mQk5QZVJRdWNvT25vM3UtdGJEV0wtS05ueDNfTnpKSmFpMnNyMmN0d1R0YUNoQWRGaHV6OE1yaTJmNlVfV0t2aXJTSk4weFg1SFh0YjhGSlh6aEJ1Y3pQT2pZMDB4QmNVMXlj?oc=5&quot;&gt;BarristerNG.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: